OL,5,G2100 The Party
OL,6,     FJournalist Martin Gilmour arrives
OL,7,     Ffor the lavish birthday party of
OL,8,     Fhis lifelong friend, charismatic
OL,9,     Fpolitician Ben Fitzmaurice. The
OL,10,     Fevent is thrown into turmoil with
OL,11,     Fthe news that the Conservative
OL,12,     Fleader has resigned, and Ben's
OL,13,     Farch-enemy Jarvis Conrad intends
OL,14,     Fto stand for election. While
OL,15,     FMartin warns his friend against
OL,16,     Fany knee-jerk response, Ben is
OL,17,     Fdetermined that Martin should help
OL,18,     Fhim undermine Jarvis' bid. Drama,
OL,19,     Fstarring Luke Evans and Tom Cullen
